# Woods Reader — Contexto IA

## App
Android lector EPUB/PDF + TTS offline (Sherpa ONNX es_ES-davefx-medium). Kotlin, Jetpack Compose, Material 3 (tema HiddenForest), Hilt, Room v11, Readium 3.x, Media3, Coil3, PDFBox.
Package: com.example.woodsreader. Módulo aparte: keymaker.

## Stack
- UI: Compose + Material 3
- Persistencia: Room (books, highlights, bookmarks, reading_sessions, collections, reading_stats, tts_rules, grafo: graph_entity/alias/relation/mention)
- Parseo: Readium 3.x (EPUB), PDFBox (PDF)
- Audio: Media3 / ExoPlayer
- TTS: Sherpa ONNX offline (TtsManager) + Android TTS fallback
- DI: Hilt (6 módulos en di/)

## Paquetes clave
